    "summary": "The Flow of Magic of your army includes:\n\n- Your deployment zone, at all times\n- No Man's Land during a phase if, as it starts, you control half or more of its objective markers\n- The opposing deployment zone, on the same terms\n\nFor Psychic Attacks by your **THOUSAND SONS** models, **Wound rolls** of 1 may be re-rolled; a model wholly within the Flow of Magic adds 1 to those Wound rolls instead.",
